WEBVTT

00:03.147 --> 00:07.407
<b>So distancing yourself 
from her won't solve anything.</b>

00:07.777 --> 00:11.827
<b>R-Really? The female heart is complicated.</b>

00:11.827 --> 00:13.247
<b>I'd better take notes.</b>

00:14.207 --> 00:19.317
<b><i>Sitting here talking like this
has become our daily routine lately.</i></b>

00:20.367 --> 00:21.907
<b>Thanks again.</b>

00:21.907 --> 00:23.877
<b>Well, I'm going to class.</b>

00:23.877 --> 00:25.867
<b>Wait, me too.</b>

00:28.387 --> 00:29.587
<b>Watch out!</b>

00:35.307 --> 00:37.107
<b>S-Sorry, Yuiga!</b>

00:37.107 --> 00:39.607
<b>I-It's okay, but be careful.</b>

00:39.807 --> 00:43.767
<b><i>That was dangerous.
If someone saw that...</i></b>

00:51.167 --> 00:54.327
<b><i>The last person who should've seen that is here!</i></b>

00:54.327 --> 00:56.037
<b>Oh, hi, Ogata.</b>

