Episode 7: A Former Tutor's Secret Spot Is X

02:33.257 --> 02:36.357
<b><i>Ri was clearly furious this morning.</i></b>

02:38.457 --> 02:42.707
<b>Oh... It's Yuiga... and Fumino.</b>

02:42.707 --> 02:44.537
<b>I didn't even notice.</b>

02:45.387 --> 02:47.687
<b><i>An obvious sarcastic attack?</i></b>

02:47.977 --> 02:51.157
<b>D-Does Ogata seem
to be in a bad mood today?</b>

02:51.157 --> 02:52.987
<b><i>Wh-What should I do?</i></b>

02:55.197 --> 02:56.367
<b>Sorry.</b>

02:56.367 --> 02:58.327
<b>Wh-What is it? What's wrong?</b>

02:59.117 --> 03:00.627
<b>Nothing.</b>

03:02.627 --> 03:03.627
<b><i>I-It's like...</i></b>

03:04.247 --> 03:07.207
<b><i>when a mother bird
protects her precious eggs!</i></b>

03:07.207 --> 03:11.237
<b><i>A will of steel that keeps
anything else from getting close!</i></b>

03:11.237 --> 03:12.717
<b><i>In other words...</i></b>

03:12.717 --> 03:16.677
<b><i>It was the hug! That hug was behind this!</i></b>

03:17.597 --> 03:21.137
<b>Y-Yuiga! I've got your second exercise 
about a woman's heart.</b>

03:21.437 --> 03:24.607
<b>Gently take Ri by the hand
and escort her inside.</b>

03:25.687 --> 03:26.707
<b>Why?</b>

03:30.787 --> 03:34.317
<b>F-Furuhashi. This is pretty embarrassing.</b>

03:34.777 --> 03:37.367
<b>Are you sure this will improve her mood?</b>

03:37.367 --> 03:40.287
<b>Y-Yeah. I'm pretty sure.</b>

03:43.527 --> 03:45.747
<b><i>Is she still mad?</i></b>

03:45.747 --> 03:49.587
<b><i>Just holding hands didn't seem 
to satisfy her at all.</i></b>

03:50.687 --> 03:52.377
<b>So your dad...</b>

03:52.377 --> 03:54.757
<b>Yes, so I had no choice.</b>

03:54.757 --> 03:58.557
<b><i>M-Maybe she's cross-examining him
about this morning's hug?</i></b>

03:58.557 --> 04:02.477
<b><i>If that was the cause of her bad mood...</i></b>

04:02.477 --> 04:06.857
<b><i>then clearly another hug
would put her in a better mood!</i></b>

04:07.857 --> 04:09.237
<b>Sorry, Yuiga!</b>

04:14.277 --> 04:16.867
<b><i>There, have a passionate embrace!</i></b>

04:16.867 --> 04:21.117
<b><i>With this, Ri will let this 
morning's hug be forgiven!</i></b>

04:23.657 --> 04:24.787
<b><i>Wait, what?</i></b>

04:32.967 --> 04:35.887
<b>Y-Your usual glasses were broken?</b>

04:35.887 --> 04:37.027
<b>Yes.</b>

