05:15.547 --> 05:18.467
<b><i>July 14th. The Storming of the Bastille.</i></b>

05:19.047 --> 05:22.387
<b><i>I haven't had much time
to study for myself lately,</i></b>

05:22.387 --> 05:25.057
<b><i>so I'd better use any free time I have.</i></b>

05:45.867 --> 05:47.207
<b>A little more...</b>

05:47.707 --> 05:49.917
<b>What are you doing?</b>

05:51.037 --> 05:52.747
<b>Oh! Ms. Kirisu!</b>

05:58.377 --> 06:01.927
<b><i>Wow, it's like she's flying!</i></b>

06:03.507 --> 06:05.607
<b>Ms. Kirisu!</b>

06:09.727 --> 06:13.717
<b>That was dumb.
That was a dumb thing to do.</b>

06:13.717 --> 06:16.937
<b>Are you okay, Ms. Kirisu?
I feel somewhat at fault.</b>

06:20.777 --> 06:22.367
<b>I'll be fine from here.</b>

06:22.367 --> 06:24.737
<b>Then I'll be on my way.</b>

06:24.737 --> 06:27.617
<b>If the pain gets worse,
please see a doctor.</b>

06:27.957 --> 06:29.527
<b>I will. Thank you.</b>

06:37.087 --> 06:40.047
<b>Ms. Kirisu! I heard a big crash.</b>

06:40.047 --> 06:41.337
<b>Are you all right?</b>

06:42.027 --> 06:45.057
<b>Hey! Seriously, are you okay, Ms. Kirisu?</b>

06:45.807 --> 06:47.117
<b><i>What should I do?</i></b>

06:47.117 --> 06:49.097
<b><i>I can't just walk in there.</i></b>

06:49.097 --> 06:51.577
<b><i>But if something happened to her...</i></b>

06:54.017 --> 06:56.397
<b>E-Excuse me, Ms. Kirisu.</b>

06:56.397 --> 06:57.627
<b>I'm coming in!</b>

07:07.697 --> 07:09.757
<b><i>It's a pigsty!</i></b>

07:11.347 --> 07:13.207
<b>I-I'll get you out of there!</b>

07:13.207 --> 07:14.787
<b>Just hold on!</b>

07:23.897 --> 07:26.637
<b><i>The apartment of a woman who lives alone...</i></b>

07:26.637 --> 07:28.697
<b><i>Man, I can't relax.</i></b>

07:29.897 --> 07:32.267
<b>You helped me.</b>

07:32.267 --> 07:35.897
<b>I'll get you some tea at least
after I change, so wait here.</b>

07:38.567 --> 07:42.677
<b><i>She must be changing clothes in there right now.</i></b>

07:42.677 --> 07:45.067
<b><i>I bet her casual clothes are mature, too.</i></b>

07:49.537 --> 07:52.117
<b><i>Idiot! What are you thinking?</i></b>

07:52.867 --> 07:55.737
<b>Thanks for waiting.
Is coffee okay?</b>

07:55.737 --> 07:57.997
<b>Y-Yes! Thank you.</b>

08:03.217 --> 08:05.677
<b><i>I can't believe she's wearing
high school sweats!</i></b>

08:09.767 --> 08:13.977
<b>Ms. Kirisu, your private image
and school image are different.</b>

08:13.977 --> 08:15.687
<b>Do you have a problem with that?</b>

08:15.687 --> 08:18.767
<b>No. I guess you're not trying to hide it, huh?</b>

08:18.767 --> 08:21.067
<b>Of course, only in front of you.</b>

08:22.317 --> 08:26.427
<b>After seeing all this, 
trying to hide would be a wasted effort.</b>

08:27.407 --> 08:32.037
<b><i>If someone overheard that,
they might get the wrong idea.</i></b>

08:32.037 --> 08:33.557
<b>All right, Yuiga.</b>

08:34.737 --> 08:35.707
<b>Take it out.</b>

08:37.327 --> 08:39.837
<b>I-I don't have any money.</b>

08:39.837 --> 08:41.047
<b>That's insulting.</b>

08:41.527 --> 08:44.567
<b>Who do you think I am?</b>

08:45.507 --> 08:48.847
<b><i>Oh, she meant take out
my textbook and notebook.</i></b>

08:49.127 --> 08:52.677
<b>Originally, the Bastille prison was a fortress.</b>

08:52.677 --> 08:57.167
<b>The people were furious at the king
for dismissing the popular Necker,</b>

08:57.167 --> 09:00.477
<b>so they broke into the prison
in search of weapons and ammunition.</b>

09:00.477 --> 09:02.437
<b>That's known as the Storming of the Bastille.</b>

09:02.857 --> 09:05.447
<b>Listen, before memorizing history,</b>

09:05.447 --> 09:08.467
<b>you should get a grasp
on the relationship of events.</b>

09:08.467 --> 09:12.617
<b>When you don't understand why something
happened, you should ask questions.</b>

09:13.327 --> 09:15.367
<b><i>She's thoughtful and easy to understand.</i></b>

09:15.367 --> 09:18.807
<b><i>She not only gave me coffee for helping,
but is helping me study.</i></b>

09:18.807 --> 09:22.647
<b><i>When all is said and done,
she's a caring teacher.</i></b>

09:26.607 --> 09:29.717
<b><i>Whoa, I've been here for two hours.</i></b>

09:29.717 --> 09:31.817
<b><i>Was I that focused?</i></b>

09:33.267 --> 09:34.227
<b>What is this?</b>

09:43.247 --> 09:44.567
<b>Forget about this!</b>

09:47.417 --> 09:50.727
<b>Ms. Kirisu, I can't hold back any longer!</b>

09:56.247 --> 09:57.437
<b>Please let me clean up!</b>

09:57.437 --> 10:00.037
<b>Th-That's indecent!
No way for a child to speak!</b>

10:01.447 --> 10:02.547
<b>Indecent?</b>

10:05.427 --> 10:07.357
<b>Let's clean up right now.</b>

10:09.947 --> 10:11.217
<b>Sorry about this.</b>

10:11.777 --> 10:16.417
<b>My younger siblings at home
always make a mess, so it bugs me.</b>

10:18.867 --> 10:19.437
<b>Oops.</b>

10:24.777 --> 10:27.187
<b>So many trophies...</b>

10:27.737 --> 10:31.807
<b>So you were a figure skater 
in your student days, Ms. Kirisu?</b>

10:32.287 --> 10:35.537
<b>Are these like memories
of your brilliant youth?</b>

10:36.857 --> 10:38.807
<b>It's not worth discussing.</b>

10:40.217 --> 10:44.337
<b>Do you know how long
a female figure skater's career lasts?</b>

10:44.767 --> 10:47.157
<b>No, not really.</b>

10:47.157 --> 10:51.797
<b>Generally, from late teens to early 20's.</b>

10:52.387 --> 10:55.907
<b>There are various reasons,
like physical and financial issues.</b>

10:55.907 --> 10:57.847
<b>It's short-lived.</b>

10:57.847 --> 11:02.347
<b>Compared to other sports, it's extremely brief.</b>

11:03.287 --> 11:04.767
<b>A long time ago...</b>

11:04.767 --> 11:07.527
<b>There was a woman who spent 
too much of her limited time</b>

11:07.527 --> 11:13.277
<b>on fleeting emotions and went down
a meaningless path and never made it back.</b>

11:14.767 --> 11:16.577
<b>She was a fool, wasn't she?</b>

11:19.267 --> 11:20.637
<b>I know it.</b>

11:20.637 --> 11:22.827
<b>That's how it was with me.</b>

11:23.637 --> 11:25.787
<b>When you say "a woman," do you mean...</b>

11:29.107 --> 11:32.217
<b>To that woman, this is self-admonition.</b>

11:32.847 --> 11:36.527
<b>A symbol of regret, so she 
never forgets why this happened.</b>

11:37.707 --> 11:39.417
<b>And thus, a conclusion.</b>

11:39.417 --> 11:43.227
<b>Regardless of students' feelings,
an educator should firmly guide them</b>

11:43.227 --> 11:46.317
<b>towards the path where their talent lies.</b>

11:48.177 --> 11:49.597
<b>Don't you agree?</b>

11:50.067 --> 11:53.157
<b>What do you think, Yuiga?</b>

11:57.267 --> 11:58.487
<b>I don't know.</b>

11:58.977 --> 12:03.117
<b>I'm just a student, I don't have
that kind of experience.</b>

12:03.667 --> 12:07.917
<b>And as for them, I'm not confident 
that they can be happy.</b>

12:09.107 --> 12:10.127
<b>But...</b>

12:11.167 --> 12:12.717
<b>But when...</b>

12:13.687 --> 12:16.677
<b>there are people seriously
taking on something they "can't do,"</b>

12:16.677 --> 12:20.257
<b>instead of telling them to give up
and turning my back on them,</b>

12:20.257 --> 12:22.977
<b>I choose to hold my head high
and regret it later with them.</b>

12:25.717 --> 12:30.897
<b>If you're an ally of the talented,
I'm an ally of the no-talents.</b>

12:35.187 --> 12:36.237
<b>Oh?</b>

12:36.717 --> 12:37.997
<b>We're parallel lines.</b>

12:40.657 --> 12:42.447
<b>You were a big help with the cleaning.</b>

12:42.447 --> 12:43.947
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:43.947 --> 12:48.207
<b>N-No, I really appreciate
you helping me study.</b>

12:49.577 --> 12:52.047
<b>Um... You're sure it was okay?</b>

12:53.267 --> 12:57.887
<b>I'm a student, but it wasn't 
a problem having a man over?</b>

12:57.887 --> 13:00.177
<b>Huh? A man?</b>

13:00.177 --> 13:02.847
<b>Stupid question.
Give yourself another ten years.</b>

13:02.847 --> 13:04.387
<b>S-Sorry!</b>

13:05.087 --> 13:09.397
<b>You would know, of course,
being an adult woman yourself!</b>

13:09.397 --> 13:12.757
<b>The neighbors will hear you,
so go home already.</b>

13:21.367 --> 13:25.377
<b><i>Bungler. I-I was a nervous wreck!</i></b>

13:30.037 --> 13:36.677
<b><i>He didn't figure out this was the first time
a man has ever been in my room, right?</i></b>

13:42.427 --> 13:46.497
<b>Maybe I'll make a habit
of cleaning up a bit more.</b>

13:46.937 --> 13:51.937
<b></b>To think there would be 
a chance to use them...

13:46.937 --> 13:51.937
<b></b>A pair of mug cups I received 
from a friend's wedding

13:54.937 --> 13:57.607
<b>Eh? You went to Ms. Kirisu's apartment?</b>

13:58.107 --> 14:02.027
<b>Y-Yeah, it just turned out that way.</b>

14:02.027 --> 14:04.117
<b>Hey, Furuhashi, you're in my space.</b>

14:05.247 --> 14:09.987
<b>Anyway, the important point
isn't that I went to her place.</b>

14:09.987 --> 14:13.837
<b>She's surprisingly serious about
 teaching and isn't a bad person.</b>

14:13.837 --> 14:15.547
<b>So you should try talking to her—</b>

14:15.547 --> 14:18.117
<b>It's an important point!
What are you doing?</b>

14:18.117 --> 14:20.497
<b>The fact that you went 
to her apartment is important!</b>

14:21.467 --> 14:27.427
<b><i>Teacher or not, if Ri and Uruka
found out he went to a woman's apartment...</i></b>

14:27.707 --> 14:31.217
<b>Well, I thought it was
kind of improper myself,</b>

14:31.217 --> 14:33.857
<b>but she said I wouldn't be a man
for ten years, so it's okay.</b>

14:34.207 --> 14:37.317
<b><i>It's not okay at all, Yuiga!</i></b>

14:38.457 --> 14:39.987
<b>Yoohoo, Rizzy!</b>

14:41.617 --> 14:43.977
<b>Have you seen Fuminocchi and Nariyuki?</b>

14:43.977 --> 14:46.747
<b>No, I haven't seen them. What's up?</b>

14:46.747 --> 14:48.957
<b>What? What's wrong, Furuhashi?</b>

14:47.007 --> 14:48.957
<b>I've just been looking around for them.</b>

14:48.957 --> 14:50.997
<b>H-Hey, come here!</b>

14:54.227 --> 14:59.227
<b>Yuiga, you can't tell
anyone else what you told me!</b>

14:59.627 --> 15:02.047
<b>Especially Ri and Uruka!</b>

15:02.507 --> 15:03.507
<b>Wh-Why?</b>

15:03.507 --> 15:06.137
<b>That's the third exercise
to understand a woman's heart!</b>

15:06.137 --> 15:07.567
<b>The third!</b>

15:08.067 --> 15:09.697
<b>Roger that, Master!</b>

15:10.847 --> 15:13.437
<b>I'm glad you understand, Yuiga.</b>

15:13.437 --> 15:15.027
<b>That's a promise now!</b>

15:18.567 --> 15:25.117
<b><i>Sheesh, Yuiga is completely
unaware of the rumors about him.</i></b>

15:25.117 --> 15:27.997
<b><i>He can't afford to act so carelessly.</i></b>

15:27.997 --> 15:29.587
<b>Furuhashi!</b>

15:30.367 --> 15:34.207
<b>Furuhashi, are you going out
with Yuiga in Class B?</b>

15:35.697 --> 15:37.917
<b>What are you talking about, Kashima?</b>

15:38.767 --> 15:40.627
<b>You don't have to be shy about it.</b>

15:41.187 --> 15:45.007
<b>After all, you had him
pinned against that tree earlier!</b>

15:43.047 --> 15:51.767
<b>Maybe a little edited</b>

15:43.047 --> 15:51.767
<b>Maybe a little edited</b>

15:43.047 --> 15:51.767
<b>Maybe a little edited</b>

15:45.007 --> 15:49.597
<b>That's Ichinose Academy's
most popular spot for couples!</b>

15:49.597 --> 15:51.767
<b>Under the sacred tree behind the school!</b>

15:52.367 --> 15:55.437
<b><i>I was the most careless of all!</i></b>

15:55.437 --> 15:58.147
<b><i>That tree's a romantic spot?</i></b>

15:58.147 --> 16:01.067
<b><i>If this becomes a rumor, I'm done for!</i></b>

16:01.487 --> 16:03.487
<b>N-No, actually...</b>

16:03.487 --> 16:05.907
<b>For real? Furuhashi and Yuiga?</b>

16:05.907 --> 16:07.907
<b>Then the girl he was rumored to kiss is...</b>

16:07.907 --> 16:14.287
<b>What the hell? The prince who broke
Sleeping Beauty's curse is that dull dweeb?</b>

16:16.627 --> 16:20.547
<b>W-We're not!
Yuiga just helps me study.</b>

16:20.547 --> 16:23.257
<b>We don't have anything
to feel guilty about!</b>

16:23.547 --> 16:26.867
<b>It's my fault for making it
look like something's going on,</b>

16:26.867 --> 16:30.347
<b>but these rumors are rude to Yuiga,
so let's end it right here.</b>

16:30.347 --> 16:31.767
<b>Hey, Furuhashi!</b>

16:32.477 --> 16:36.497
<b>Let's get going!
It'll just be you and me today!</b>

16:38.207 --> 16:40.277
<b><i>You idiot!</i></b>

16:41.687 --> 16:44.317
<b>I'm surprised you came here, Yuiga!</b>

16:44.317 --> 16:48.657
<b>So is it true that you and Furuhashi
have a special relationship?</b>

16:48.657 --> 16:50.407
<b>Answer honestly!</b>

16:50.407 --> 16:55.077
<b><i>That's it, Yuiga. If you answer honestly,
I bet they'll understand!</i></b>

16:55.457 --> 16:57.327
<b>Special relationship...</b>

16:57.947 --> 17:02.337
<b><i>I'm her tutor and Furuhashi is my "master"...</i></b>

17:02.337 --> 17:04.467
<b>Well, I guess you could say it's special.</b>

17:05.927 --> 17:07.887
<b><i>You idiot!</i></b>

17:07.887 --> 17:11.907
<b>W-We're not! We don't have
any kind of relationship like that!</b>

17:12.617 --> 17:15.487
<b>I'm missing something here,
but let's get a move on.</b>

17:15.487 --> 17:17.807
<b>I don't want to waste a single second.</b>

17:18.707 --> 17:20.687
<b>He picked up Furuhashi's bag
like it was second nature.</b>

17:20.687 --> 17:22.527
<b>She really must be special!</b>

17:22.527 --> 17:25.517
<b>Wait, Yuiga!</b>

17:25.517 --> 17:28.197
<b>There's a misunderstanding! And rumors!</b>

17:36.247 --> 17:41.247
<b><i>What a headache.
Everyone in my class has the wrong idea.</i></b>

17:41.247 --> 17:45.407
<b><i>What'll I do if it becomes a rumor
that Ri and Uruka hear about?</i></b>

17:48.077 --> 17:50.397
<b>You're sure keeping your distance today.</b>

17:50.397 --> 17:52.467
<b>It's hard to teach you like this.</b>

17:52.467 --> 17:55.627
<b>R-Really? This seems normal to me.</b>

17:55.627 --> 17:58.217
<b>Excuse me. Could you move over?</b>

18:02.567 --> 18:06.817
<b>For some reason, there are
more people in the library than usual.</b>

18:06.817 --> 18:08.527
<b>Y-Yeah, there are...</b>

18:11.707 --> 18:15.747
<b>Everyone is in position.
Can you read me? Over.</b>

18:18.527 --> 18:19.917
<b>I read you loud and clear.</b>

18:20.327 --> 18:25.047
<b>Members of 3-A's Protect
Sleeping Beauty Club a.k.a. Wild Roses,</b>

18:25.047 --> 18:29.837
<b>Princess Fumino is the pride
of our class and source of solace,</b>

18:29.837 --> 18:35.217
<b>so let's determine whether
her boyfriend is truly worthy of her.</b>

18:35.217 --> 18:36.977
<b>I agree with that...</b>

18:36.977 --> 18:39.597
<b>But did we have to take it this far?</b>

18:40.267 --> 18:44.147
<b>If he turns out to be
a worthless womanizer...</b>

18:45.477 --> 18:48.987
<b>we have to see to it 
that he never approaches her again.</b>

18:48.987 --> 18:51.047
<b>You're really fired up.</b>

18:52.597 --> 18:56.627
<b>Hey, Furuhashi, you made lots of simple mistakes.</b>

18:57.187 --> 18:58.577
<b>Ah, sorry.</b>

18:59.207 --> 19:03.967
<b><i>Jeez! I'm bad enough at math as it is.
I need to focus!</i></b>

19:03.967 --> 19:07.777
<b><i>Yuiga is doing his best to tutor me.</i></b>

19:07.777 --> 19:11.177
<b><i>At this rate, he'll give up on me.</i></b>

19:13.547 --> 19:14.927
<b>Hey, Yuiga.</b>

19:16.277 --> 19:21.807
<b>Did Ms. Kirisu tell you to 
make us change our chosen subjects?</b>

19:22.807 --> 19:25.067
<b>Well, she did say something like that.</b>

19:26.857 --> 19:30.397
<b>But more importantly, look.
Another silly mistake.</b>

19:30.397 --> 19:32.607
<b>Listen, if you want
to get a good score in math,</b>

19:32.607 --> 19:34.677
<b>you need to be able to calculate.</b>

19:34.677 --> 19:39.997
<b>Practice by repetition until 
you can solve them automatically.</b>

19:39.997 --> 19:42.787
<b>If you think too much about the calculations,</b>

19:42.787 --> 19:46.487
<b>there won't be enough space
in your head for the hard problems.</b>

19:47.047 --> 19:51.507
<b>Sorry! I'll try not to make any mistakes,
so let me do it again!</b>

19:54.277 --> 19:57.147
<b><i>This isn't at all like I imagined.</i></b>

19:57.147 --> 19:59.467
<b><i>There's no spark between them.</i></b>

20:06.607 --> 20:08.817
<b><i>Well, as long as we're here...</i></b>

20:08.817 --> 20:10.587
<b><i>Maybe we should study, too.</i></b>

20:13.237 --> 20:15.817
<b>m 796 97 l 1561 97 1561 287.125 796 287.125 796 97 m 805 106 l 805 278.125 1552 278.125 1552 106 805 106</b>

20:13.237 --> 20:15.817
<b>m 805 106 l 1552 106 1552 278.125 805 278.125</b>

20:13.237 --> 20:15.817
<b>The Next Day</b>

20:13.237 --> 20:15.817
<b>The Next Day</b>

20:16.517 --> 20:18.937
<b>You seem tired, Furuhashi.</b>

20:18.937 --> 20:20.537
<b>Yeah, a little...</b>

20:21.167 --> 20:24.867
<b><i>I was so focused on studying
yesterday that I forgot about it,</i></b>

20:24.867 --> 20:27.567
<b><i>but what if that rumor spreads?</i></b>

20:29.857 --> 20:30.707
<b>Oh!</b>

20:31.087 --> 20:33.047
<b>Good morning, Furuhashi.</b>

20:33.047 --> 20:36.547
<b>Kashima! It's not what it looks like!
I just ran into him before!</b>

20:36.547 --> 20:38.307
<b>I mean, it's all a misunderstanding!</b>

20:38.307 --> 20:42.227
<b>Yes, I know. Good luck with the studying.</b>

20:43.307 --> 20:46.767
<b><i>She believes me? Just like that?</i></b>

20:48.087 --> 20:50.067
<b>I'll see you in a bit.</b>

20:51.877 --> 20:53.447
<b>Thank goodness!</b>

20:53.447 --> 20:55.447
<b>What? What are you talking about?</b>

20:58.467 --> 21:01.447
<b><i>I can tell they're connected by a deep trust</i></b>

21:01.447 --> 21:06.117
<b><i>that transcends the boyfriend-girlfriend barrier.</i></b>

