22:40.847 --> 22:42.547
<b>People were talking about that?</b>

22:42.797 --> 22:46.467
<b>Th-That must've been
a major pain. Sorry.</b>

22:46.467 --> 22:49.097
<b>No, it wasn't a pain.</b>

22:49.097 --> 22:51.307
<b>Besides, the whole thing
started because of me.</b>

22:55.447 --> 22:59.277
<b>Say, maybe we should
just go out for real?</b>

23:00.587 --> 23:03.947
<b>Just kidding! It was a joke!</b>

23:03.947 --> 23:05.327
<b>Did I surprise you?</b>

23:07.877 --> 23:09.867
<b>A joke! It was just a joke!</b>

23:09.867 --> 23:12.947
<b>Th-That's right! You scared me!</b>

23:12.947 --> 23:17.087
<b>S-Sorry! That wasn't like me to say, was it?</b>

23:17.087 --> 23:20.547
<b>Why are you embarrassed now?</b>

23:20.547 --> 23:22.357
<b>Forget it! Forget it!</b>

23:22.967 --> 23:26.047
<b><i>Yeah. It's okay.
It would never happen.</i></b>

23:26.767 --> 23:29.307
<b><i>I could never fall in love...</i></b>

23:29.307 --> 23:31.567
<b><i>with someone my friends are in love with.</i></b>

